    {
      "id": "be453411-831f-43f2-81e9-bcc3e8f2de92",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe como hay aparece na imagem.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "7b92f186-a6bb-476c-9e99-d07d77733d55",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe a frase.</p><p><strong>En esta calle hay una farmacia.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Nesta rua há uma farmácia.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/172621a0c247498380e91140ef17b0a8_b01-calle-con-farmacia.png?Expires=1794099476&Signature=YuWsgOLHJRVlQf~jnaOHKBRvYRN3oEcDsjAbpDwh8vpFV1IBjsWky2bSxboKBGmlRcLycbeUK2xCq1MkGgMZuQioxn751aCgerOe~h9pfK6brlZPae9UDhM-EPArz7GJjJmrcl7QS6C8-LT4D-tPYvu5rEBxRm5lR-ELw4VHR5AapMl5Q6hOeP-YZOao7K7ZscVczuctKk-4cFrk8AA4T3y4zT4SRlpwKlxntDedp65DIICSob0C3s0HAxf3KJ18HbM6w3odzVmxfgYmjrY1~C4LMp0Sk3GLpvU9sqvz~Gz6edD5~tqpL-k5HPBz3aUIF8NZWaA8p4b2Etoj18Jf5w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
